      a0 stays within a factor 4              -> f <= 0.1218
      a0 stays within a factor 10             -> f <= 0.3597
  [PASS] the refit a0 falls MONOTONICALLY with f (the CDM component really is replacing the modification)   (a0/a0_0 from 1.000 at f=0 to 0.0033 at f=1)
  [PASS] at FULL CDM (f=1) the modification is switched off: refit a0 below 5% of its f=0 value   (a0(f=1)/a0(0) = 0.0033)

